          "Require a verdict per element: <em>keep (has a job)</em> or <em>cut (decorative).</em> No \"maybe.\" The forced call is where the learning is.",
          "Remind them the goal is not to cut everything — a kept decorative element is fine <em>if</em> they can justify it by context.",
